🇮🇱🤝🇬🇷 The IDF Chief of the General Staff, LTG Eyal Zamir, met with the Chief of the Hellenic National Defense General Staff, General Dimitrios Choupis, who completed his official visit to Israel.

The visit highlights the strategic importance and relevance of the military relationship already in place between Israel and Greece. This relationship has been steadily encouraging a longstanding partnership between both countries.

